<li id="bib.bib20" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Hendrycks et al. (2021)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Dan Hendrycks, Collin Burns, Steven Basart, Andy Zou, Mantas Mazeika, Dawn
